Exercise 1: System Information

Write a shell script that displays:

Username
Hostname
Current working directory
Current date and time

Hint: whoami, hostname, pwd, date
*********
#!/bin/bash

echo "Username: $(whoami)"
echo "Hostname: $(hostname)"
echo "Current Directory: $(pwd)"
echo "Current Date & Time: $(date)"
##############################
Exercise 2: Directory Creator

Write a shell script that asks the user for a directory name.

If the directory already exists, display an appropriate message.
Otherwise, create the directory.

Concepts: read, mkdir, if
***************************
#!/bin/bash
echo "Enter directory name:"
read dname
if [ -d "$dname" ]
then
    echo "Directory already exists."
else
    mkdir "$dname"
    echo "Directory created."
fi
