Exercise 4: Largest Number

Read three numbers from the user and print the largest.

Concepts:

read
if
Logical operators
**********************
#!/bin/bash
echo "Enter three numbers:"
read a b c

if [ $a gt $b ] && [ $a gt $c ]
then
    echo "Largest = $a"
elif [ $b gt $a ] && [ $b gt $c ]
then
    echo "Largest = $b"
else
    echo "Largest = $c"
fi
